  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%9A%A8%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98-%EB%B0%9C%ED%99%94%EC%A0%90/2793), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59624180)\n\nThe word \"first\" carries a sense of excitement.\nA feeling experienced for the first time, a journey taken for the first time, a food tasted for the first time.\nFor Hyojung, \"first\" isn't something grand.\nRather, it's something indifferent.\n\nThough it was her first day of high school,\nfor Hyojung, it was a day when she didn't want to care about anything,\na day when she just wanted to go home.\nEven to Hyojung, new friends naturally approach,\nbut opening her heart isn't easy for her.\n\nAmidst this, a story reaches Hyojung's ears.\nThe subject is a quiet, reserved child in her class.\nThat child's name is Ha-an.\n\nA grim rumor follows Ha-an:\nsomeone refused his confession,\nso Ha-an set something on fire.\nHyojeong draws a line, dismissing it as none of her concern.\nBut life never flows according to one's intentions.\n\nAfter witnessing a peculiar scene,\nHyojeong finds herself unable to ignore Ha-an.\n\nHyojeong saw it.\nThe flames rising from Ha-an's body...",
